    "message": "Move test_resource_queue_regressions.py under tests/integration\n\nOnly the file move, named after the feature instead of \"regressions\",\nso its history stays traceable. The next commit moves its unit tests\nnext to the modules they check and switches the file to the shared\ngenerated Scenario (#88).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
