    },
    "message": "Check entered-stock runs and their parts on the shared generated Scenario\n\nThe tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder (seed 7,\nentered stock). The unit tests did not depend on the entered stock, so\nthey now use the shared generated_scenario fixture; the day-long run\npasses 30 evacuees, a day and the stock to generated_previews, and\nstill checks that the preview has no approval blockers (#88).\n\nThe unit tests move next to what they check: the stall record to\ntests/unit/domain/test_queueing.py, the request-history outcomes to\ntests/unit/core/test_world.py and the in-room route start to\ntests/unit/domain/test_movement.py. The long_simulation run stays here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
